+        <name slugifiedName="name-the-liberalconservative-rule">The Liberal/Conservative Rule</name>
         <t indent="0" pn="section-2.9-1">A rule, first stated in STD 5/RFC 791, recognized as having benefits
 in implementation robustness and interoperability is:</t>
-        <t indent="0" pn="section-2.9-2"><artwork name="" type="" align="left" alt=""><![CDATA[
