-                   conservative in what you send".
-]]></artwork>
-</t>
+        <blockquote pn="section-2.9-2">
+          <t indent="0" pn="section-2.9-2.1">&quot;Be liberal in what you accept, and
+conservative in what you send&quot;.</t>
+        </blockquote>
         <t indent="0" pn="section-2.9-3">Or establish restrictions on what a protocol transmits, but be able
